mapping "W288.1" source="W288" target="218017003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W288 SNOMED CT 218017003 is a Swedish-ICD-10-SE extension of base ICD-10 W28 (Contact with
        powered lawnmower) subdivided by place/activity. Target SNOMED CT 435145 (concept_code 218017003)
        is the standard concept that the base W28 maps to via Athena crosswalk. The target fully
        subsumes every place/activity variant of the lawnmower accident — place and activity are
        circumstantial modifiers, not part of the clinical accident concept. Broader (one level): target
        subsumes source, verified crosswalk for the base code.
        """
}
